  "post_content": "<p>El club de patinaje local Ondawheelz ha organizado para este s&aacute;bado el Onda Summer Contest, una competici&oacute;n de Inline, Campeonato Nacional de Patinaje.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/08/DSC_1571.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p>Las pruebas se desarrollan hasta las 21&nbsp;horas en las instalaciones municipales del skatepark, en a calle Segorbe, con paella incluida pra todas las personas participantes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1566.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1567.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1567\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1568.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1569.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1570.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1571.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1572.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1573.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skate11agost2012/dsc_1574.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
